  "causal_findings": [
    {
      "source": "node_file.v24.13.cc 393-410",
      "finding": "CloseReq Resolve/Reject construct InternalCallbackScope and unconditionally call the persistent Resolver followed by Maybe.Check; neither tests scope.Failed nor a void constructor return."
    },
    {
      "source": "node-api-callback.v24.13.cc 42-105; async_wrap.cc.v24.13.txt 92-104,141-144",
      "finding": "InternalCallbackScope pushes IDs, sets pushed_ids_, then invokes void EmitBefore without checking a result. Emit wraps the actual hook Call with kFatalRethrowStackOverflow."
    },
    {
      "source": "node-errors.v24.13.cc 702-725; v8-api.v24.13.cc 2780-2802,2820-2824,2867-2875",
      "finding": "The selected ordinary stack-overflow catch calls ReThrow then Reset. Reset returns when rethrow_ is true; the V8 TryCatch base destructor reinstalls the actual exception. Other non-terminated caught hook errors retain original fatal policy."
    },
    {
      "source": "v8-api-macros.v24.13.h 42-69,116-120; v8-api-inl.v24.13.h 168-207; v8-api.v24.13.cc 8686-8717",
      "finding": "Resolver Resolve/Reject use ENTER_V8, not PREPARE_FOR_EXECUTION. No preexisting-ordinary-pending precheck initializes has_exception. The returned Maybe tests the selected internal operation, not a fabricated empty result based solely on the earlier hook error."
    },
    {
      "source": "v8-objects.v24.13.cc 5067-5130",
      "finding": "For selected CloseReq Resolve(undefined), primitive resolution proceeds to Fulfill; Reject(error) proceeds to Reject, whose return is a nonempty Handle. A prior ordinary before-hook rethrow alone is not evidence of a MaybeCheck failure."
    },
    {
      "source": "support/src/extensions/native_node_callback_scope.zig 668-688; original/src/extensions/native_node_file_handle_close_request.zig settleBody",
      "finding": "Current Scope.init returns the ordinary EmitBefore error after initialized and pushed_ids; the proposed predecessor try returns early before selecting the promise Global or performing settlement. This is a concrete void-continuation mismatch."
    },
    {
      "source": "support/src/extensions/native_node_commonjs_owned_boundary.zig 22-35,77-89,122-162; support/src/extensions/native_node_weak_global.zig 34-41; support/vendor/quickjs/quickjs.c 61090-61113",
      "finding": "record(s,err) captures the actual ordinary completion in the existing caller Scope. Same-scope pending checks do not fail merely because that Scope owns a previous reason. Thus Global Get and the actual native Promise setter execute without injecting a stale current exception into its deliberately strict borrowed-operation entry. Scope.finish preserves the real hook reason after native callback-scope destruction."
    }
  ],
